    "excerpt": "Effective Date: 14 May 2025 App Name: TruePrice Developer: Dr. Sam From the TruePrice.Cash blog on markets and investing.",
    "content": "<nav class=\"toc\" aria-label=\"In this article\">\n<div class=\"toc-title\">In this article</div>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"#section\">In this article</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#1-introduction\">1. Introduction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#2-data-collection\">2. Data Collection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#3-data-sharing\">3. Data Sharing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#4-permissions-used\">4. Permissions Used</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#5-children-s-privacy\">5. Children’s Privacy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#6-your-rights\">6. Your Rights</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#7-changes-to-this-policy\">7. Changes to This Policy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#8-contact-us\">8. Contact Us</a></li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"section\">\n<h2>In this article</h2>\n<p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> 14 May 2025 <strong>App Name:</strong> TruePrice <strong>Developer:</strong> Dr. Sam</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"1-introduction\">\n<h2>1. Introduction</h2>\n<p>This Privacy Policy describes how TruePrice collects, uses, and protects information when you use our mobile application. By using the app, you agree to the practices outlined in this policy.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"2-data-collection\">\n<h2>2. Data Collection</h2>\n<p>TruePrice does <strong>not collect any personal information</strong> directly from users.</p>\n<p>However, the app may access or process the following data to provide its core functionality:</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Network access:</strong> to fetch stock prices and financial data via secure APIs</li><li><strong>Device language and region settings:</strong> to localize app content and support language switching</li><li><strong>Usage data (anonymized):</strong> may be collected via Google Play Console or crash reporting tools to help improve the app</li></ul>\n<p>🔒 <strong>Note:</strong> No personal identifiers (like name, email, contacts, or device ID) are collected, stored, or transmitted by this app.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"3-data-sharing\">\n<h2>3. Data Sharing</h2>\n<p>TruePrice does <strong>not sell or rent your data</strong>. We do not share user data with third parties except:</p>\n<ul><li><strong>API providers</strong> (e.g., financial data services) for retrieving public stock information</li><li><strong>Analytics services</strong> (e.g., Google Play Console) for usage statistics and crash reporting</li></ul>\n<p>All data shared is <strong>non-personal and anonymized</strong>.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"4-permissions-used\">\n<h2>4. Permissions Used</h2>\n<p>TruePrice may request access to:</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Network state</strong>: to check for internet availability</li><li><strong>Storage (optional)</strong>: only if exporting data or screenshots is supported in future versions</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"5-children-s-privacy\">\n<h2>5. Children’s Privacy</h2>\n<p>TrueStock is <strong>not directed to children under 13</strong> and does not knowingly collect any personal information from them. If you believe we’ve unintentionally collected data from a child, please contact us for immediate deletion.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"6-your-rights\">\n<h2>6. Your Rights</h2>\n<p>Since no personal data is collected or stored, you are not required to register, opt-in, or manage any user account with us.</p>\n<p>If this changes in future versions, users will be informed and offered privacy controls accordingly.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"7-changes-to-this-policy\">\n<h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>\n<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with the updated effective date.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"8-contact-us\">\n<h2>8. Contact Us</h2>\n<p>If you have any questions about this policy, please contact:</p>\n<p><strong>Email:</strong> husamalahmadi@gmail.com <strong>Developer Name:</strong> Dr. Sam <strong>Country:</strong> Saudi Arabia</p>\n</section>",
